<title>MALAYSIA: Dunham-Bush (Malaysia) 6-mth net jumps.</title>
<headline>Dunham-Bush (Malaysia) 6-mth net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		7.44	 vs	 3.85</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    18.3	  vs	 11.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		202.12	 vs	125.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 12.09	 vs	  6.54</p>
<p>    Minorities		0.88	 vs	  0.44</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)   10.0	  vs	  nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Dunham-Bush (Malaysia) Bhd. It is involved in selling air-conditioning and refrigeration equipment. -- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
